Implemented the item-6 instructor roster visibility slice and updated evidence docs. The slice adds `parseInstructorClassRosterRow`, `createSupabaseInstructorClassRosterReader` (`app/infrastructure/auth-tenancy/instructor-class-roster-supabase-reader.ts:39`), and a protected `/instructor/dashboard` roster panel that renders only roster-safe fund id/student id/current AUM data while excluding holdings, target weights, order details, provider payloads, worker jobs, realtime payloads, and future scenario rows.

Updated docs/story evidence, including new `docs/stories/US-110-instructor-class-roster-visibility-ui.md`, plus product docs, backlog, and `docs/TEST_MATRIX.md`; also corrected stale “initial asset-holding seeding pending” references where applicable.

