- `npm run validate:quick` — 56 files, 546 tests passed.
- `npm run smoke:routes` — passed for `/`, `/login`, `/join/ALPHA01`, `/dashboard`, and `/instructor/dashboard`.

The protected instructor UI could only be route-smoked locally; authenticated browser interaction remains pending because local Supabase auth/session configuration is not present. No commit, push, or PR was created.

